msgid "The page text does not state your key facts, so AI has only your markup to go on."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນໜ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນສຳຄັນຂອງທ່ານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ AI ຈຶ່ງມີແຕ່ markup ໃຫ້ອີງໃສ່."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2678
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2747
msgid "The pairing code is invalid or has expired."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຈັບຄູ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ໝົດອາຍຸແລ້ວ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4139
