#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3348
msgid "There is no site key to regenerate."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີກະແຈເວັບໄຊໃຫ້ສ້າງໃໝ່."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1166
msgid "These collect content to train AI models. They are not needed to appear in AI answers, so this is your choice."
msgstr "ພວກມັນເກັບເນື້ອຫາເພື່ອຝຶກໂມເດວ AI. ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອປາກົດໃນຄຳຕອບຂອງ AI, ສະນັ້ນທ່ານເລືອກໄດ້ເອງ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1148
msgid "These fetch your pages to answer and cite them. Your existing robots.txt rules, such as /wp-admin/, keep applying to them."
msgstr "ພວກມັນດຶງໜ້າເວັບຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອຕອບຄຳຖາມ ແລະ ອ້າງອີງ. ກົດ robots.txt ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງທ່ານ ເຊັ່ນ /wp-admin/ ຍັງຄົງນຳໃຊ້ກັບພວກມັນ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4814
msgid "These were inferred from your existing settings and published content. Only blank fields were filled, so please check that the values are right."
msgstr "ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອະນຸມານຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ ແລະ ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ເຜີຍແຜ່ແລ້ວ. ຕື່ມສະເພາະຊ່ອງທີ່ວ່າງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ກະລຸນາກວດສອບວ່າຄ່າຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2733
msgid "This code belongs to a site registered as %s. Pair it from that site, or correct the site address on the dashboard."
msgstr "ລະຫັດນີ້ເປັນຂອງເວັບໄຊທີ່ລົງທະບຽນເປັນ %s. ຈັບຄູ່ຈາກເວັບໄຊນັ້ນ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຢູ່ເວັບໄຊໃນແດຊບອດ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4566
msgid "This is a beta feature. AI answers vary from run to run, so judge by the trend rather than any single result."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດ beta. ຄຳຕອບຂອງ AI ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ຕັດສິນຈາກແນວໂນ້ມແທນຜົນຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2812
msgid "This license has no seats left. Release another site from the Nurevo dashboard, or use a license with more seats."
msgstr "ລິຂະສິດນີ້ບໍ່ມີສິດໃຊ້ງານເຫຼືອແລ້ວ. ປົດເວັບໄຊອື່ນອອກຈາກແດຊບອດ Nurevo ຫຼື ໃຊ້ລິຂະສິດທີ່ມີສິດໃຊ້ງານຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2815
msgid "This license is not attached to an account yet. Please contact Nurevo support."
msgstr "ລິຂະສິດນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມກັບບັນຊີ. ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ທີມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ Nurevo."

