#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1902
msgid "Your key facts, headings and FAQ are readable in the page text."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ມູນສຳຄັນ, ຫົວຂໍ້ ແລະ FAQ ຂອງທ່ານອ່ານໄດ້ໃນຂໍ້ຄວາມໜ້າ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4490
msgid "Your Pro plan is active. Measurement needs a site key and site ID to be configured."
